1
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:06,540
I have had to become very, very good at being alone.

2
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:13,200
That is what healing somehow causes.

3
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:19,900
You become practiced at it.

4
00:00:22,030 --> 00:00:28,530
Because so much of protecting your peace requires, unfortunately, isolation.

5
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:33,680
But maybe it's not really just, it's not really isolation.

6
00:00:33,860 --> 00:00:34,900
That's not the word to use.

7
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:37,820
I think a better word to use is solitude.

8
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:46,380
But there's something that happens in your healing where it doesn't feel like loneliness.

9
00:00:47,520 --> 00:00:49,500
It just feels like peace.

